"<b>Hayir</b> diyebilirsiniz.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<b>{} physical disks</b> could not be read ({}).<br><br>Accessing physical "
"disks requires {} privileges. Restart the application with elevated "
"privileges now?<br><br><i>Disk image files (.img, VHD, VDI...) do not "
"require privileges; if you only work with image files you can answer "
"<b>No</b>.</i>"

