#: src/diskultimate/ui/main_window.py:795
msgid ""
"<b>{}</b> bir DiskUltimate yedegidir. Icerigi <b>salt okunur</b> olarak "
"gezebilirsiniz: bolumler, klasorler ve dosyalar gorunur, dosyalari disa "
"aktarabilirsiniz.<br><br><b>Kaynak boyut:</b> {}<br><b>Yedek boyut:</b> "
"{}<br><b>Olusturma:</b> {}<br><br>Yedegi bir <b>diske veya goruntuye "
"yazmak</b> icin: <i>Disk &gt; Yedegi diske yaz...</i>"
msgstr ""
"<b>{}</b> is a DiskUltimate backup. You can browse its contents "
"<b>read-only</b>: partitions, folders and files are visible and you can "
"export files.<br><br><b>Source size:</b> {}<br><b>Backup size:</b> "
"{}<br><b>Created:</b> {}<br><br>To <b>write the backup to a disk or "
"image</b>: <i>Disk &gt; Write backup to disk...</i>"

#: src/diskultimate/ui/dialogs/bootloader.py:275
msgid ""
"<b>{}</b> diskindeki onyukleme kodu ({}) kaldirilacak.<br><br>Bolum "
"tablosu ve dosyalar <b>korunur</b>; ama bu diskten acilan sistem artik "
"acilmaz.<br><br>Islem hemen yapilmaz: bekleyen islemlere eklenir ve "
"\"Uygula\" dediginizde calisir."
msgstr ""
"The boot code ({}) on disk <b>{}</b> will be removed.<br><br>The partition "
"table and files are <b>kept</b>; but the system started from this disk "
"will no longer boot.<br><br>Nothing happens yet: the step is added to the "
"pending operations and runs when you choose \"Apply\"."

#: src/diskultimate/ui/dialogs/tools.py:281
msgid "<b>{}</b> dosya imzasi bulundu."
msgstr "<b>{}</b> file signatures found."

#: src/diskultimate/ui/main_window.py:3114
