"degisiklikler bekleyen islem olarak birikir ve diske ancak <b>Uygula</b> "
"dediginizde yazilir."
msgstr ""
"<b>{}</b> is open read-only — this is <b>normal</b>.<br><br>Your changes "
"are collected as pending operations and are written to the disk only when "
"you choose <b>Apply</b>."

