msgstr ""
"<br><br>Close the other program using the file (another disk tool, backup "
"software, etc.) and press <b>Retry</b>."

#: src/diskultimate/ui/main_window.py:3190
msgid ""
"<h3>{} {}</h3><p>Disk goruntusu, sanal disk ve <b>sistemdeki gercek "
"diskler</b> uzerinde bolumleme, bicimlendirme, yedekleme ve kurtarma "
"araci.</p><p><b>Teknoloji:</b> Python 3 + PyQt5, harici bagimlilik "
"yok<br><b>Bolum tablolari:</b> MBR (mantiksal bolumler dahil), GPT, "
"MBR&nbsp;&harr;&nbsp;GPT donusumu<br><b>Bicimlendirme:</b> FAT12/16/32, "
"exFAT, ext2/3/4 ve NTFS — sekizi de saf Python, uc platformda<br><b>Dosya "
"erisimi:</b> FAT ve exFAT tam okuma/yazma</p><p>Goruntu dosyalari yonetici "
"yetkisi gerektirmez. Fiziksel disk erisimi yonetici/root ister ve "
"<b>varsayilan olarak salt okunurdur</b>; yazma ayrica onay ister.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>{} {}</h3><p>A tool for partitioning, formatting, backing up and "
"recovering disk images, virtual disks and <b>real disks on this "
"system</b>.</p><p><b>Technology:</b> Python 3 + PyQt5, no external "
"dependencies<br><b>Partition tables:</b> MBR (including logical "
"partitions), GPT, MBR&nbsp;&harr;&nbsp;GPT "
"conversion<br><b>Formatting:</b> FAT12/16/32, exFAT, ext2/3/4 and NTFS — "
"all eight in pure Python, on three platforms<br><b>File access:</b> full "
"read/write for FAT and exFAT</p><p>Image files do not require "
"administrator privileges. Physical disk access requires administrator/root "
"and is <b>read-only by default</b>; writing asks for separate "
"confirmation.</p>"

#: src/diskultimate/ui/dialogs/tools.py:74
